1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,640
Kate Beckinsale posted "bye"

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:03,340
and turned off the comments.

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:04,720
Another message read:

4
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:06,360
Congratulations you won.

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:07,540
I give up.

6
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,300
Just weeks earlier,

7
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,680
she'd opened up about PTSD

8
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,680
describing how people can appear fine

9
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,560
while privately

10
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,700
battling nightmares and trauma.

11
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,650
She's also faced criticism

12
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,370
about her body

13
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,700
while grieving her mother.

14
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,710
In August, she cleared her Instagram

15
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:23,160
after comments about her weight.

16
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,640
What these latest posts mean

17
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,720
remains unclear,

18
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,090
and her representative

19
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:29,970
hadn't responded to a request for comment

20
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:31,040
at the time of reporting.
